OL,3,AKilling of six people in Krakow square
OL,4,A'constitutes terrorist offence', says
OL,5,APolish prosecutor
OL,6,
OL,7,FPolice are continuing to investigate
OL,8,Fafter six people were killed in a
OL,9,Fshooting in Krakow's market square
OL,11,FThe head of Poland's police force,
OL,12,FMarek BoroED, says 16 more people were
OL,13,Finjured, including two police officers,
OL,14,Ffive foreign nationals and the suspect
OL,16,FThree other bodies were found at the
OL,17,Fsuspect's home, with police saying they
OL,18,Fwere identified as the 25-year-old's
OL,19,Fparents and sister
OL,23,APub: 08-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
